  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 — re-release of 1.0.0 packaged end-to-end by the standard release workflow; tracks PostQuantum.FileEncryption 1.0.1 in lockstep. The .pqfe container format (v2) is FROZEN for the 1.x line. No library code change since 1.0.0. Closes the supply-chain loop so the published nupkg, the build-provenance attestation, and a clean-room Linux rebuild are all the same bytes. EnablePackageValidation against the 1.0.0 baseline. See CHANGELOG.md.",
